{"4566450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kim's Farm", "steam_appid": 4566450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kim’s Farm</strong> is a story-driven survival experience inspired by real accounts from North Korean defectors who were once imprisoned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endure to survive</strong><br>To receive food rations, you must complete daily labor.<br>Surveillance, reporting, and obedience are part of everyday life.<br>Information can be gained through secret conversations,<br>and you may need to eat whatever you can catch to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect your family</strong><br>You play as a young girl struggling to survive with her mother and sister.<br>Every decision carries risk, and each choice affects not only your fate, but theirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find a way out</strong><br>Your father has disappeared.<br>To survive, you must escape—and find him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A reality difficult to believe</strong><br>The conditions depicted in this game are based on real testimonies.<br>Some aspects cannot be fully portrayed,<br>but the experience offers a glimpse into a world that still exists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a story of survival.<br>It is a story of those who longed for their voices to be heard beyond the walls that confined them</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kim’s Farm</strong> is a story-driven survival experience inspired by real accounts from North Korean defectors who were once imprisoned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endure to survive</strong><br>To receive food rations, you must complete daily labor.<br>Surveillance, reporting, and obedience are part of everyday life.<br>Information can be gained through secret conversations,<br>and you may need to eat whatever you can catch to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect your family</strong><br>You play as a young girl struggling to survive with her mother and sister.<br>Every decision carries risk, and each choice affects not only your fate, but theirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find a way out</strong><br>Your father has disappeared.<br>To survive, you must escape—and find him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A reality difficult to believe</strong><br>The conditions depicted in this game are based on real testimonies.<br>Some aspects cannot be fully portrayed,<br>but the experience offers a glimpse into a world that still exists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a story of survival.<br>It is a story of those who longed for their voices to be heard beyond the walls that confined them</p>", "short_description": "Kim’s Farm is a story-driven survival experience inspired by real accounts from North Korean defectors who were once imprisoned. Torture and violence can take your life. Breaking the rules can lead to immediate execution. You play as a young girl struggling to survive with her mother and sister.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4566450/5ac244e2b919af15cc2bd27c2192428ba4dfcfce/header.jpg?t=1784771856", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4566450/51b64445c76aa4aebd7f7ea9cd0d156559f8ad11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784771856", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4566450/51b64445c76aa4aebd7f7ea9cd0d156559f8ad11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784771856", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU: GTX 970,  GTX 1060 / RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</str